# Inferring a subject's class from a property domain
#
# The teaches property has Teacher as its domain, and Alice teaches logic.
# An explicit N3 rule follows that domain declaration to derive that Alice
# is a teacher.

@prefix : <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#> .
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#> .

# Sample data
:teaches rdfs:domain :Teacher .
:alice :teaches :logic .

# Inference rules
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

{
    ?P rdfs:domain ?C .
    ?X ?P ?Y
} => {
    ?X a ?C
} .
